{"body": [{"y0": 65.1, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 317.4, "text": "Done e|ris fe|lix mul|tos nume|rábis a|micos."}, {"y0": 79.8, "x0": 139.6, "x1": 316.5, "text": "Aut pró|desse vo|lunt aut| delec|tàre po|étae."}, {"y0": 93.5, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 366.9, "text": "Caelum,| nor animum máü|tant qui| tráns mare| currunt."}, {"y0": 108.5, "x0": 140.9, "x1": 237.2, "text": "[V] Versus pentameter."}, {"y0": 120.7, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 414.6, "text": "cui tamel|rí ipsa fa|ves || vincaf|fille pre|cor. 265"}, {"y0": 136.7, "x0": 150.6, "x1": 395.4, "text": "Hic versus dividitur in duàs partes, quárum utraque binos"}, {"y0": 150.6, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 395.4, "text": "pedes et dimidium continet. Ita versus tótus ex quinque pedi-"}, {"y0": 164.4, "x0": 140.5, "x1": 395.4, "text": "bus cónstat et vocatur pentameter: quinque enim Graecé dici-"}, {"y0": 178.1, "x0": 140.5, "x1": 395.4, "text": "tur pente. Utraque pars est ut initium hexametri, sed pars"}, {"y0": 192.3, "x0": 140.5, "x1": 414.5, "text": "posterior spondeos non admittit: 270"}, {"y0": 205.1, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 310.8, "text": "—«|--|-I--I--I—"}, {"y0": 218.4, "x0": 150.8, "x1": 308.4, "text": "Tempora| si fue|rint || nábila| solus ?|ris."}, {"y0": 233.0, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 298.4, "text": "In gremi]ó se|dit || protinu|$illa meo."}, {"y0": 248.1, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 358.7, "text": "Versus pentameter semper hexametrum sequitur:"}, {"y0": 260.0, "x0": 140.0, "x1": 414.8, "text": "Nó amó| tà, Sabi|di, nec| possum| dicere| quare. 275"}, {"y0": 274.1, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 321.2, "text": "Hoc tan|tum pos|sum || dicere| norí amó| te."}, {"y0": 289.9, "x0": 141.0, "x1": 262.7, "text": "[VI] Versus hendecasyllabus."}, {"y0": 302.9, "x0": 150.6, "x1": 279.6, "text": "Passer mortuu$est meae puellae."}, {"y0": 317.6, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 395.4, "text": "Hic versus, qui ündecim syllabàs habet, vocatur hendeca-"}, {"y0": 331.5, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 415.2, "text": "syllabus, nam Zndecim Graece hendeca dicitur. Versus hende- 280"}, {"y0": 345.3, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 395.2, "text": "casyllabus in quinque pedés dividi potest: spondeum, dacty-"}, {"y0": 358.5, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 393.8, "text": "lum, duos trochaeós, spondéum aut trochaeum (pés primus"}, {"y0": 372.7, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 274.6, "text": "rárius iambus aut trochaeus est)."}, {"y0": 392.1, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 160.3, "text": "E"}, {"y0": 399.5, "x0": 150.9, "x1": 415.0, "text": "Vivà|mus mea| Lesbi'|atqu'a| mémus. 285"}, {"y0": 414.1, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 294.0, "text": "Cená|bis bene| mi Fa|bull'a|pud me"}, {"y0": 428.0, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 280.7, "text": "paucis| si tibi| di fa|vent di|ébus."}, {"y0": 457.1, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 193.4, "text": "PENSVM A"}, {"y0": 471.0, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 395.7, "text": "Hi versüs in syllabas breves et longas et in pedes dividendi"}, {"y0": 485.0, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 224.4, "text": "sunt notis appositis:"}, {"y0": 498.3, "x0": 140.5, "x1": 348.0, "text": "Scribere mé quereris, Velóx, epigrammata longa."}, {"y0": 512.4, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 372.0, "text": "Ipse nihil scribis: tü, breviora facis! [Martialis 1.110]"}, {"y0": 526.6, "x0": 140.0, "x1": 348.2, "text": "Dàs numquam, semper prómittis, Galla, rogant."}, {"y0": 540.3, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 347.9, "text": "Si semper fallis, iam rogó, Galla, nega! [/1.25]"}], "margin": [{"y0": 79.8, "x0": 37.7, "x1": 140.0, "text": "[(Horátius: Ars poetica333, |."}, {"y0": 89.9, "x0": 43.3, "x1": 105.4, "text": "Epistulae 1.11.27]"}, {"y0": 149.3, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 83.5, "text": "25-2525"}, {"y0": 222.6, "x0": 39.7, "x1": 90.7, "text": "Vocàábula nova:"}, {"y0": 231.6, "x0": 39.2, "x1": 77.0, "text": "scalpellum"}, {"y0": 242.9, "x0": 39.2, "x1": 58.4, "text": "opera"}, {"y0": 249.8, "x0": 39.2, "x1": 58.6, "text": "lüdus"}, {"y0": 259.7, "x0": 39.2, "x1": 71.6, "text": "certàmen"}, {"y0": 267.8, "x0": 39.0, "x1": 70.1, "text": "gladiator"}, {"y0": 277.7, "x0": 39.2, "x1": 52.5, "text": "réte"}, {"y0": 286.8, "x0": 39.4, "x1": 71.2, "text": "spectátor"}, {"y0": 295.3, "x0": 39.2, "x1": 60.6, "text": 